An example of a biased simulation for the LiCl/Pd(100) ion-association energetics study presented in Fig. 4.
Alongside LAMMPS/ELECTRODE, one needs a compiled PLUMED (https://www.plumed.org/) linked against the LAMMPS executable to apply the harmonic bias.
The simulation data from multiple umbrella sampling windows with different bias centers were obtained using WHAM (https://github.com/apallath/WHAM).
